. * Restarting an unconditional fit: coefficients (theta0) and rates (rate0)
. quietly nwsaom, waves(glasgow1 glasgow2 glasgow3) outdegree reciprocity gwesp(.69) unconditional s
> eed(4)

. matrix b = e(b)

. matrix r = e(rates)

